    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="68fc9760-15dd-5be3-9c3d-c88a597f259d" activityNameId="66c084ec-72a7-5adf-951f-58dbabf6c9e8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Shed</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Shed
The module includes a timber construction, closed on three sides. One part of the shed is a fireproofed garage closed with doors. Size: 264 m2 whole shed, 102 m2 fireproofed garage. Lifetime of the building is 50 years.;
Synonyms: Maschinenhalle; 
UUID: 85fa99a7-35ef-3304-b353-5f7fffe53098
The inventory takes into account the use of construction materials and building machines for construction, repair and replacement including waste disposal and the transportation of the materials to the building site. Not taken into account were direct emission of the construction, disposal of production waste and the use of resources during utilization phase. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The data of the inventory are based on one example of a typical agricultural building.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The inventory is calculated based on a solid database of agricultural buildings. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_85fa99a7-35ef-3304-b353-5f7fffe53098.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
